Error: Jet.MisplacedVariadicParameter: Variadic parameter `first` must be last
  --> Tests/UI/variadic_not_last.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | bad: fn(first: ...String, last: String) {
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: A `name: ...T` rest parameter collects every trailing argument, so nothing may follow it
 Fix: Move `first` to the end of the parameter list, or remove the `...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MisplacedVariadicParameter
